{"id": "DfM0lL4x-6V", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Karna nark mein, Duryodhan swarg mein? Mahabharat ke aakhri adhyay ka sach, aur ek kahani jo granth mein nahi. Follow karo.\n\nMahabharat, Svargarohana Parva, adhyay 1 se 3. Yudhishthir sharir ke saath swarg pahunche to wahan Duryodhan chamakte aasan par baitha tha. Unhone poocha, mere bhai kahan hain, Karna kahan hai?\n\nEk devdoot unhe nark le gaya. Wahan Karna, Bhim, Arjun, Nakul, Sahadev aur Draupadi ki aawazein aayin. Yudhishthir ne swarg chhod kar nark mein rehna chuna.\n\nTab Indra aur Dharmraj prakat hue. Indra ne kaha, ye maaya thi. Har raja ko ek baar nark dekhna padta hai, aur Drona se kiye chhal ki wajah se Yudhishthir ko bhi chhal se nark dikhaya gaya. Surya-putra Karna apne ooche sthaan par the.\n\nKarna ko swarg mein khane ki jagah sona milne wali kahani Mahabharat mein nahi hai. Wo Pitru Paksha se judi lok-katha hai.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Episode 5.\n\n#mahabharata #karna #yudhishthir #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793539171, "like_count": 23760, "comment_count": 28, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4660484077529811a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.787, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPQ9oOdlP5-QF0v3eHNoeWlrVTVShGRe-jCvCoKT43L4cfRCB2xRh_3LC27dY6ZwTY-pH8waOfFtcngoOO1_m0hrOb47i9AXw_-NbI.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Adoj9C0uQzE11RYGKvO087OQNglIfa9DD6cxkhupg-eVJPgG0AXLjrzETrKgVEPP9EmpYSpttycxgVHPYu7HsoAz&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=inst